{
  "version": 8,
  "name": "Unmapp Cream",
  "metadata": {
    "unmapp:purpose": "The map cartography for app-design/v1/04-mapa.png: a cream basemap that reads as part of the app rather than as a map dropped into it.",
    "unmapp:colors": "background #F7F4EE = colors.background, roads #E5E3DD = colors.border, greenery #CFDCC0 = colors.mapHalo, buildings #EFEAE1 derived. Water #DDE4E3 is the only value with no token behind it - add colors.mapWater to src/design/tokens.ts if it stays.",
    "unmapp:labels": "Four: cities and districts from place_label, street names from the road layer, and landmarks from poi_label. The first draft had none, on the theory that a discovery app should not name what it asks you to find - which was wrong for streets, since without them you cannot tell where you are standing. Note that building names are not in the building layer; in Mapbox Streets v8 they arrive as POIs. Still absent: house numbers (housenum_label), transit stops (transit_stop_label) and natural features such as park names (natural_label) - add them by copying label-poi onto those source layers.",
    "unmapp:poi-filter": "POI labels are filtered by class, not only by density. Filtering on filterrank alone surfaced whatever is large and commercial: in downtown San Francisco that meant eight hotel names and nothing else, the opposite of what this app is for. The whitelist keeps landmark, historic, park_like, arts_and_entertainment and visitor_amenities. Because the class list does the real work, filterrank can be the looser <= 3 without the map filling up. food_and_drink is deliberately off for now even though the domain has a 'jedzenie' category - in a city centre it is hundreds of points and would bring the clutter straight back. Turn it on when the filter screen exists and the user can ask for it.",
    "unmapp:label-language": "text-field reads `name`, the local name, which in Poland is Polish. Mapbox Streets v8 has no name_pl - localized fields stop at name_en, name_de, name_fr and a dozen others. So the map cannot follow the app's Polish/English switch from this file alone. If English labels are ever wanted, publish a second style whose text-field is [\"coalesce\", [\"get\", \"name_en\"], [\"get\", \"name\"]] and pick the URL by language in src/components/map/map-style.ts. Styles are billed per user, not per style, so a second one costs nothing.",
    "unmapp:label-font": "Poppins, the same sans the app uses, and hosted by Mapbox - no font upload needed. The weights follow src/design/tokens.ts rather than map convention: districts use Poppins Regular to match the eyebrow style they imitate, cities use Poppins SemiBold to match the label style. Verified against the Fonts API: Poppins Regular, Medium and SemiBold all resolve. Arial Unicode MS Regular stays as the fallback for glyphs Poppins lacks.",
    "unmapp:upload": "Mapbox Studio > New style > upload this file. Publishing gives a mapbox://styles/<username>/<id> URL that replaces MAP_STYLE_URL in src/components/map/map-style.ts. Custom fonts and icons are not carried by this file and would have to be added in Studio by hand.",
    "unmapp:low-zoom": "Zoomed out, the first draft showed almost nothing: at zoom 5 over Poland a single label (Berlin), and at zoom 8 none at all. Three causes, all mine. Settlements were filtered on symbolrank with a zoom step, but symbolrank is constant across zooms - it ranks how important a place is, not how dense the labels are. filterrank is the zoom-relative density control and is what the layer uses now; symbolrank drives text size instead, which is its actual purpose. Country names and administrative boundaries were missing entirely. Major roads were 0.4 px of #E5E3DD on #F7F4EE, which is invisible.",
    "unmapp:worldview": "Mapbox requires a worldview filter on any layer using the admin source, because disputed borders differ by audience. Both admin layers use [\"all\", \"US\"], Mapbox's own default. Change it only with a reason - dropping it does not simplify the style, it makes the boundaries wrong."
  },
  "center": [19.0238, 50.2649],
  "zoom": 12,
  "bearing": 0,
  "pitch": 0,
  "sources": {
    "composite": {"type": "vector", "url": "mapbox://mapbox.mapbox-streets-v8"}
  },
  "glyphs": "mapbox://fonts/mapbox/{fontstack}/{range}.pbf",
  "layers": [
    {
      "id": "background",
      "type": "background",
      "paint": {"background-color": "#F7F4EE"}
    },
    {
      "id": "greenery",
      "type": "fill",
      "source": "composite",
      "source-layer": "landuse",
      "filter": [
        "match",
        ["get", "class"],
        ["park", "grass", "pitch", "cemetery", "scrub", "wood"],
        true,
        false
      ],
      "paint": {
        "fill-color": "#CFDCC0",
        "fill-opacity": ["interpolate", ["linear"], ["zoom"], 8, 0.35, 13, 0.6]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "greenery-large",
      "type": "fill",
      "source": "composite",
      "source-layer": "landuse_overlay",
      "filter": [
        "match",
        ["get", "class"],
        ["national_park", "wetland"],
        true,
        false
      ],
      "paint": {
        "fill-color": "#CFDCC0",
        "fill-opacity": ["interpolate", ["linear"], ["zoom"], 6, 0.25, 12, 0.45]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "water",
      "type": "fill",
      "source": "composite",
      "source-layer": "water",
      "paint": {"fill-color": "#DDE4E3"}
    },
    {
      "id": "waterway",
      "type": "line",
      "source": "composite",
      "source-layer": "waterway",
      "minzoom": 8,
      "paint": {
        "line-color": "#DDE4E3",
        "line-width": ["interpolate", ["linear"], ["zoom"], 8, 0.5, 16, 3]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "buildings",
      "type": "fill",
      "source": "composite",
      "source-layer": "building",
      "minzoom": 14,
      "filter": ["==", ["geometry-type"], "Polygon"],
      "paint": {
        "fill-color": "#EFEAE1",
        "fill-opacity": ["interpolate", ["linear"], ["zoom"], 14, 0, 15.5, 0.9]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "buildings-outline",
      "type": "line",
      "source": "composite",
      "source-layer": "building",
      "minzoom": 16,
      "filter": ["==", ["geometry-type"], "Polygon"],
      "paint": {
        "line-color": "#E5E1D7",
        "line-width": 0.6,
        "line-opacity": ["interpolate", ["linear"], ["zoom"], 16, 0, 17, 1]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "road-minor",
      "type": "line",
      "source": "composite",
      "source-layer": "road",
      "minzoom": 12,
      "filter": [
        "all",
        ["==", ["geometry-type"], "LineString"],
        [
          "match",
          ["get", "class"],
          [
            "secondary",
            "tertiary",
            "street",
            "street_limited",
            "pedestrian",
            "service",
            "track"
          ],
          true,
          false
        ]
      ],
      "layout": {"line-cap": "round", "line-join": "round"},
      "paint": {
        "line-color": "#E5E3DD",
        "line-opacity": ["interpolate", ["linear"], ["zoom"], 12, 0, 13, 1],
        "line-width": [
          "interpolate",
          ["exponential", 1.5],
          ["zoom"],
          12,
          0.3,
          14,
          0.9,
          16,
          2.2,
          18,
          6
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "road-major",
      "type": "line",
      "source": "composite",
      "source-layer": "road",
      "minzoom": 5,
      "filter": [
        "all",
        ["==", ["geometry-type"], "LineString"],
        [
          "match",
          ["get", "class"],
          ["motorway", "motorway_link", "trunk", "trunk_link", "primary"],
          true,
          false
        ]
      ],
      "layout": {"line-cap": "round", "line-join": "round"},
      "paint": {
        "line-color": "#E5E3DD",
        "line-width": [
          "interpolate",
          ["exponential", 1.5],
          ["zoom"],
          5,
          0.7,
          10,
          1.4,
          14,
          2.8,
          18,
          9
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "admin-country",
      "type": "line",
      "source": "composite",
      "source-layer": "admin",
      "filter": [
        "all",
        ["==", ["get", "admin_level"], 0],
        ["==", ["get", "maritime"], "false"],
        ["match", ["get", "worldview"], ["all", "US"], true, false]
      ],
      "layout": {"line-cap": "round", "line-join": "round"},
      "paint": {
        "line-color": "#8A8071",
        "line-opacity": 0.35,
        "line-width": [
          "interpolate",
          ["linear"],
          ["zoom"],
          2,
          0.6,
          6,
          1.2,
          10,
          1.8
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "admin-state",
      "type": "line",
      "source": "composite",
      "source-layer": "admin",
      "minzoom": 5,
      "filter": [
        "all",
        ["==", ["get", "admin_level"], 1],
        ["==", ["get", "maritime"], "false"],
        ["match", ["get", "worldview"], ["all", "US"], true, false]
      ],
      "paint": {
        "line-color": "#8A8071",
        "line-opacity": 0.2,
        "line-width": ["interpolate", ["linear"], ["zoom"], 5, 0.5, 10, 1],
        "line-dasharray": [3, 2]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "label-country",
      "type": "symbol",
      "source": "composite",
      "source-layer": "place_label",
      "minzoom": 2,
      "maxzoom": 8,
      "filter": ["==", ["get", "class"], "country"],
      "layout": {
        "text-field": ["get", "name"],
        "text-font": ["Poppins SemiBold", "Arial Unicode MS Regular"],
        "text-size": ["interpolate", ["linear"], ["zoom"], 2, 11, 5, 14, 8, 17],
        "text-letter-spacing": 0.14,
        "text-transform": "uppercase",
        "text-max-width": 7,
        "text-padding": 8
      },
      "paint": {
        "text-color": "#8A8071",
        "text-halo-color": "#F7F4EE",
        "text-halo-width": 1.4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "label-road",
      "type": "symbol",
      "source": "composite",
      "source-layer": "road",
      "minzoom": 14,
      "filter": [
        "all",
        ["==", ["geometry-type"], "LineString"],
        ["has", "name"],
        [
          "match",
          ["get", "class"],
          [
            "motorway",
            "trunk",
            "primary",
            "secondary",
            "tertiary",
            "street",
            "street_limited"
          ],
          true,
          false
        ]
      ],
      "layout": {
        "symbol-placement": "line",
        "symbol-spacing": 250,
        "text-field": ["get", "name"],
        "text-font": ["Poppins Regular", "Arial Unicode MS Regular"],
        "text-size": ["interpolate", ["linear"], ["zoom"], 14, 9, 18, 12],
        "text-max-angle": 30,
        "text-padding": 2,
        "text-rotation-alignment": "map",
        "text-pitch-alignment": "viewport"
      },
      "paint": {
        "text-color": "#8A8071",
        "text-halo-color": "#F7F4EE",
        "text-halo-width": 1.4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "label-poi",
      "type": "symbol",
      "source": "composite",
      "source-layer": "poi_label",
      "minzoom": 15,
      "filter": [
        "all",
        ["<=", ["get", "filterrank"], 3],
        [
          "match",
          ["get", "class"],
          [
            "landmark",
            "historic",
            "park_like",
            "arts_and_entertainment",
            "visitor_amenities"
          ],
          true,
          false
        ]
      ],
      "layout": {
        "text-field": ["get", "name"],
        "text-font": ["Poppins Regular", "Arial Unicode MS Regular"],
        "text-size": ["interpolate", ["linear"], ["zoom"], 15, 9.5, 18, 12],
        "text-max-width": 8,
        "text-padding": 4,
        "text-optional": true
      },
      "paint": {
        "text-color": "#8A8071",
        "text-halo-color": "#F7F4EE",
        "text-halo-width": 1.2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "label-district",
      "type": "symbol",
      "source": "composite",
      "source-layer": "place_label",
      "minzoom": 11,
      "filter": [
        "all",
        ["==", ["get", "class"], "settlement_subdivision"],
        ["<=", ["get", "filterrank"], 3]
      ],
      "layout": {
        "text-field": ["get", "name"],
        "text-font": ["Poppins Regular", "Arial Unicode MS Regular"],
        "text-size": ["interpolate", ["linear"], ["zoom"], 11, 9.5, 15, 12.5],
        "text-letter-spacing": 0.12,
        "text-transform": "uppercase",
        "text-max-width": 7,
        "text-padding": 4
      },
      "paint": {
        "text-color": "#8A8071",
        "text-halo-color": "#F7F4EE",
        "text-halo-width": 1.2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "label-settlement",
      "type": "symbol",
      "source": "composite",
      "source-layer": "place_label",
      "minzoom": 3,
      "filter": [
        "all",
        ["==", ["get", "class"], "settlement"],
        ["<=", ["get", "filterrank"], 3]
      ],
      "layout": {
        "text-field": ["get", "name"],
        "text-font": ["Poppins SemiBold", "Arial Unicode MS Regular"],
        "text-size": [
          "interpolate",
          ["linear"],
          ["zoom"],
          3,
          ["step", ["get", "symbolrank"], 12, 8, 10],
          8,
          ["step", ["get", "symbolrank"], 16, 8, 13],
          12,
          ["step", ["get", "symbolrank"], 20, 8, 16],
          16,
          ["step", ["get", "symbolrank"], 24, 8, 19]
        ],
        "text-max-width": 8,
        "text-padding": 6
      },
      "paint": {
        "text-color": "#5C5548",
        "text-halo-color": "#F7F4EE",
        "text-halo-width": 1.4
      }
    }
  ]
}
